{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/GrowYourTree.png?t=1742417320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/Steam_Gif_Grow_2.gif?t=1742417320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a selection of procedural bonsai trees and make them your own by pruning, twisting, and scraping away to craft your perfect little bonsai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/DecorateYourDiorama.png?t=1742417320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/PropsPlacement2.gif?t=1742417320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate your pot, landscape, and tree with a vast selection of props, lights, and atmospheric effects. Place a cute statue, move it around, and light it up with a cozy lantern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/TakeBeautifulPhotos.png?t=1742417320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take beautiful and cozy images with an advanced Photo Mode. Set up the picture perfect scene by changing the time of day, season, and weather. Customize the camera settings or choose from a selection of presets. Share your artwork with your friends and the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/GrowYourCollection.png?t=1742417320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save your trees and dioramas and grow your collection over time. Go back and edit your dioramas whenever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/MultipleGamemodes.png?t=1742417320\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progression Mode:</strong>\u00a0Get inspired by prompts and unlock new trees and props as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative Mode:</strong>\u00a0Unleash your full creativity with unlimited access to all the assets and tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Idle &amp; Productivity Mode:</strong>\u00a0Chill, lean back, and watch your tree grow in the background, or use productivity tools like a Pomodoro timer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/ChillRetroVibes.png?t=1742417320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in chill vibes and wind down to lofi beats and '90s retro aesthetics. Decorate your tree with cozy lanterns as you see the rain drip down and the trams run by outside your window.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403560?t=1742417320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/8ce805d46926966d36bbc9a744bc5aa0d64a4932/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742417320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/2b0b63a82b7a12f42229e384883510b2b4ef2014/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742417320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/2b0b63a82b7a12f42229e384883510b2b4ef2014/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742417320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"